        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_03_01",
      "hash64": "6774003CCC4EB6F3",
      "text": "Les statuettes Adorami se trouvent au fond\\ndu parc.\\c\\nElles représentent les Adoramis, les trois grands\\nhéros qui ont jadis protégé notre village.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_03_02",
      "hash64": "6774013CCC4EB8A6",
      "text": "Hé ! Qui a cassé les statuettes Adorami ?!\\n... Je parie que c’est Roseille !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_03_03",
      "hash64": "6774023CCC4EBA59",
      "text": "Je comprends que les Adoramis étaient en fait\\ndes méchants, mais... je les aimais bien, moi,\\r\\nces statuettes...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_03_04",
      "hash64": "6774033CCC4EBC0C",
      "text": "Merci d’avoir aidé à la reconstruction\\ndes statuettes Adorami ! J’y ai participé\\r\\nmoi aussi en faisant un don !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
